---
import ServerAddress from "./ServerAddress.astro";
import { server } from "../data/server";
---

<section class="join">
  <div class="shell join-card">
    <div class="join-copy">
      <p class="eyebrow">Cuando quieras</p>
      <h2>El mundo ya está ahí.</h2>
      <p>Entra por tu cuenta o pásate primero por Discord para saludar.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="join-actions">
      <ServerAddress compact placement="home_join" />
      <a class="button button-dark" href={server.discord} target="_blank" rel="noreferrer" data-analytics-discord="home_join">Abrir Discord</a>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
